        "mods": {
          "max": 5,
          "current": 0,
          "list": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">A Pipe Bolt-Action can accept one each of the following mods. You may not take both a Grip and a Stock Mod. Any Stock mods add the word &ldquo;Rifle&rdquo; to the end of the weapon&rsquo;s name.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Receiver:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.lZXmmJghkwx2Cfth]{Calibrated Receiver}, </span><span class=\"fontstyle2\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6BSZSiI20H86MtAb]{Hardened Receiver},&nbsp; @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.7EV6l9KqHJ6KJpQi]{Powerful Receiver}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.aGA8OrDQbWtDLvim]{.38 Receiver}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.EwCQcIIr5DwNHpqA]{.50 Receiver}</span></p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">Barrel: </span></strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.h2XEyTI2HCE7iQip]{Stub Barrel},</span><strong> </strong><span class=\"fontstyle3\">@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.6py6TtlkeywhWQl1]{Long Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.cvoae6Grdf6NGVM4]{Ported Barrel}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.RX5rg3JRCwjafiWN]{Finned Barrel}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><span class=\"fontstyle0\"><strong>Grip:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.oFXs4w5msufzhIVI]{Sharpshooter's Grip}</span><br style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; text-size-adjust: auto;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Stock: </strong>@Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.Xiya2cq2V9TZ0UFC]{Standard Stock}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.GcvxfPv8mm8bpxM7]{Marksman's Stock}, @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium.weapon-mods.esTu2kHbvyxBdSFV]{Recoil Compensating Stock}</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontstyle3\"><strong>Sights:</strong> @Compendium[fallout2d20-compendium